<section class="block" id="partner">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="partner">
      <h2>Want your product in front of buyers?</h2>
      <p>We&rsquo;re always evaluating tools to feature in our category lists. To get yours considered, tell us a little about what you offer.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:hello@topbesticles.com">Get in touch</a>
